{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>With deception.</b> For they asked that every male be circumcised, and the sons of Jacob thought that they would not agree to be circumcised — only Shechem and Hamor, out of love for the girl. And they said: since they will not all be circumcised, we will take our vengeance on them — and this is 'with deception.' Even so, by means of a complete and well-founded pretext they came upon them, as we shall explain."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:07:16.840056213Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}